#: ../../FAQs.rst:93
msgid "CharaChorder X FAQs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:95
msgid "Is there any difference between the Lite and the X?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:96
msgid "**Lite**: Can handle up to 12-key singular chords."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:97
msgid "**X**: Can handle up to 6-key singular chords initially."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:98
msgid ""
"The Lite has special keys absent on standard keyboards, which can be "
"remapped on the X."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:101
msgid "Will CCX work on a laptop?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:102
msgid ""
"Yes, it works with an external keyboard connected to a laptop, but not "
"with the laptop’s built-in keyboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:105
msgid "Will CCX work with a wireless dongle?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:106
msgid ""
"It may support some keyboards with wireless dongles, but compatibility is"
" not guaranteed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:109
msgid "Does my keyboard need NKRO support?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:110
msgid ""
"Your keyboard’s hardware affects chord functionality. If it lacks anti-"
"ghosting or NKRO support, some key combinations may not work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:113
msgid "What languages are compatible with CCX?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:114
msgid ""
"The CCX will be configured for US English. With this layout, around 30 "
"non-English languages are supported. The community can also develop "
"mappings for over 5000 different languages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:117
msgid "How well does CharaChorder X support alternate layouts?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:118
msgid ""
"Chords are mapped to letters, so the CCX will work with all layouts, "
"including custom ones (e.g., Dvorak, Colemak)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:121
msgid "How many chords come pre-loaded on the CCX?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:122
msgid "Expect a similar number of starter chords as found in the CC Lite."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:124
msgid ""
"Chord reference spreadsheet: "
"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XdbJ8DmiZRKq0oUR3LSMgl9NF8cxccADXlNUnLgxvvo/"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:128
msgid "Does the X have chord modifiers like the Lite?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:129
msgid ""
"Yes, the CCX can pluralize and modify conjugation, though some keyboard "
"keys may need to be reassigned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:132
msgid "Is CCX the same as CC Engine but with USB support?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:133
msgid ""
"Yes, the CCX contains the same hardware as the CC Engine, with an "
"additional chip for USB input. The CC Engine requires custom circuit "
"design, while the CCX is a consumer-ready product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:136
msgid "Can the X connect to an external host or network?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:137
msgid ""
"The CCX uses **HID** and **Serial over USB** protocols. It cannot connect"
" directly to a network without external software to route the traffic. "
"The Device Manager is one such software tool compatible with some "
"Chromium based browsers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:140
msgid "Will CCX work with a USB-A to USB-C adapter?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FAQs.rst:141
msgid "Yes, the CCX is compatible with USB-A-to-C adapters."
msgstr ""

